@startuml door-lock-states
title Door lock — state machine

state Locked
state Unlocked
state Alarmed

[*] --> Locked
Locked --> Unlocked : badgeScan [badgeValid]
Unlocked --> Locked : close / logEntry
Locked --> Alarmed : forceDetected / notifySecurity
Alarmed --> Locked : reset [securityCleared]
Unlocked --> [*]
@enduml
